{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Please, Adonai.</b> Our Sages said (Shevuot 32) that this Name is holy, for it is said of Him to keep my soul alive — He who has it in His hand to put to death and to bring to life; and its Targum renders: בְּבָעוּ כְּעַן ה׳." "<b>Please.</b> Do not tell me to flee to the mountain." "<b>נא.</b> A term of request."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:27.434866815Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}